{"id":72648,"date":"2026-11-02T18:34:10","date_gmt":"2026-11-02T18:34:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72648"},"modified":"2026-11-02T19:38:27","modified_gmt":"2026-11-02T18:38:27","slug":"corrida-e-caminhada-natal-com-zins","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-e-caminhada-natal-com-zins\/","title":{"rendered":"2\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada Natal com Zins 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">2\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada Natal com Zins 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>2\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada Natal com Zins 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>13 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, na freguesia de <strong>Prazins Santo Tirso<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Guimar\u00e3es<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>). Com partida e chegada instaladas na <strong>Rua Arnaldo Borges<\/strong>, junto ao <strong>Centro Comunit\u00e1rio Sebasti\u00e3o Martins<\/strong>, o evento alia a competi\u00e7\u00e3o de estrada homologada ao esp\u00edrito natal\u00edcio e solid\u00e1rio minhoto, contando com a antiga atleta ol\u00edmpica <strong>Dulce F\u00e9lix<\/strong> como madrinha e <strong>Francisco Rodrigues<\/strong> como padrinho da edi\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo arranca \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> com a <strong>Mini Corrida de 1 km<\/strong> destinada aos escal\u00f5es jovens, seguindo-se \u00e0s <strong>10:15<\/strong> a <strong>Corrida de 9 km<\/strong> (cronometrada, com pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es por g\u00e9nero e escal\u00e3o) e \u00e0s <strong>10:20<\/strong> a <strong>Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria de 4,5 km<\/strong>. O tra\u00e7ado percorre as art\u00e9rias de Prazins Santo Tirso \u2014 passando pela Rua do Talho, Rua da Mamoela, Rua de S\u00e3o Jos\u00e9, Igreja Paroquial de Prazins Santo Tirso e EM583-3 \u2014 num ambiente festivo em pleno cora\u00e7\u00e3o do concelho ber\u00e7o da nacionalidade.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Ra\u00edzes e Horizontes de Prazins Santo Tirso<\/strong>, em parceria com a <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Braga<\/strong>, a <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Guimar\u00e3es<\/strong> e a <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Prazins Santo Tirso<\/strong>, a prova destaca-se pela sua forte vertente social: 50% do valor das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es da caminhada reverte diretamente como donativo a favor da <strong>CERCIGUI<\/strong> (Cooperativa de Educa\u00e7\u00e3o e Reabilita\u00e7\u00e3o de Cidad\u00e3os com Incapacidade de Guimar\u00e3es), incluindo ainda trof\u00e9u especial para a equipa ou grupo mais numeroso.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">13 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Rua Arnaldo Borges (Centro Comunit\u00e1rio Sebasti\u00e3o Martins), Prazins Santo Tirso, Guimar\u00e3es, Braga<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 1