<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida Natal com Zins (9 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:15<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Oficial (FPA Competi\u00e7\u00f5es):<\/strong> 7,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 07\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria CERCIGUI (4,5 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:20<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Com T-shirt e Kit Garantido:<\/strong> 7,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 06\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mini Corrida Kids (1 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a 2\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada Natal com Zins 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 13 de dezembro de 2026, com partida e chegada na Rua Arnaldo Borges, junto ao Centro Comunit\u00e1rio Sebasti\u00e3o Martins, na freguesia de Prazins Santo Tirso, concelho de Guimar\u00e3es (Braga).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida de cada dist\u00e2ncia?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inicia-se \u00e0s 09:30 com a Mini Corrida de 1 km para escal\u00f5es jovens, seguindo-se um aquecimento conjunto \u00e0s 09:45, a partida da Corrida competitiva de 9 km \u00e0s 10:15 e a partida da Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria de 4,5 km \u00e0s 10:20. A cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios est\u00e1 agendada para as 11:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e at\u00e9 quando posso garantir o kit?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem o custo de 7,50 \u20ac tanto na Corrida de 9 km (inscri\u00e7\u00f5es at\u00e9 7 de dezembro na plataforma FPA Competi\u00e7\u00f5es) como na Caminhada de 4,5 km (t-shirt e kit garantidos para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es at\u00e9 6 de dezembro de 2026, com limite de 400 participantes). Na caminhada, 50% do valor reverte a favor da CERCIGUI.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de participante e onde pode ser levantado?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O kit inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, copo reutiliz\u00e1vel, medalha de participa\u00e7\u00e3o, abastecimento final e seguro de acidentes pessoais. O levantamento decorre no Centro Comunit\u00e1rio Sebasti\u00e3o Martins no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro (09:00 \u00e0s 18:00), e no domingo, 13 de dezembro (08:00 \u00e0s 09:00).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a 2\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada Natal com Zins 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Ra\u00edzes e Horizontes de Prazins Santo Tirso, com o apoio t\u00e9cnico da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Braga, da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Guimar\u00e3es e da Junta de Freguesia de Prazins Santo Tirso.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"2\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada Natal com Zins 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-13\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-13\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Rua Arnaldo Borges (Centro Comunit\u00e1rio Sebasti\u00e3o Martins), Prazins Santo Tirso, Guimar\u00e3es\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Guimar\u00e3es\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A 2\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada Natal com Zins 2026 realiza-se a 13 de dezembro em Prazins Santo Tirso, Guimar\u00e3es, com 9 km, 4,5 km e 1 km. Garante j\u00e1 a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/corrida-e-caminhada-natal-com-zins-2026.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida Natal com Zins (9 km)\", \"price\": \"7.50\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/raizesehorizontes.pt\/2a-corrida-e-caminha-natal-com-zins-2026\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria CERCIGUI (4,5 km)\", \"price\": \"7.50\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/raizesehorizontes.pt\/2a-corrida-e-caminha-natal-com-zins-2026\/\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Ra\u00edzes e Horizontes de Prazins Santo Tirso\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a 2\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada Natal com Zins 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 13 de dezembro de 2026, com partida e chegada na Rua Arnaldo Borges, junto ao Centro Comunit\u00e1rio Sebasti\u00e3o Martins, na freguesia de Prazins Santo Tirso, concelho de Guimar\u00e3es (Braga).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida de cada dist\u00e2ncia?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa inicia-se \u00e0s 09:30 com a Mini Corrida de 1 km para escal\u00f5es jovens, seguindo-se um aquecimento conjunto \u00e0s 09:45, a partida da Corrida competitiva de 9 km \u00e0s 10:15 e a partida da Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria de 4,5 km \u00e0s 10:20. A cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios est\u00e1 agendada para as 11:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e at\u00e9 quando posso garantir o kit?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem o custo de 7,50 \u20ac tanto na Corrida de 9 km (inscri\u00e7\u00f5es at\u00e9 7 de dezembro na plataforma FPA Competi\u00e7\u00f5es) como na Caminhada de 4,5 km (t-shirt e kit garantidos para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es at\u00e9 6 de dezembro de 2026, com limite de 400 participantes). Na caminhada, 50% do valor reverte a favor da CERCIGUI.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o kit de participante e onde pode ser levantado?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O kit inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, copo reutiliz\u00e1vel, medalha de participa\u00e7\u00e3o, abastecimento final e seguro de acidentes pessoais. O levantamento decorre no Centro Comunit\u00e1rio Sebasti\u00e3o Martins no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro (09:00 \u00e0s 18:00), e no domingo, 13 de dezembro (08:00 \u00e0s 09:00).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza a 2\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada Natal com Zins 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Ra\u00edzes e Horizontes de Prazins Santo Tirso, com o apoio t\u00e9cnico da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Braga, da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Guimar\u00e3es e da Junta de Freguesia de Prazins Santo Tirso.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":72652,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,478,624],"event_type_2":[52,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-72648","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-guimaraes-braga","event_type-caminhada","event_type-cor